import{_ as n,o as a,c as t,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 820 | Transcended Ones and Planes | Perpetual Maintenance of Plane-Law Stability","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 820 | Transcended Ones and Planes | Perpetual Maintenance of Plane-Law Stability","no":820,"module":4,"tags":["Transcended One","Plane","Law Stability","Perpetual Maintenance","Law-Anchor Authority"],"related":["27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance","20-Anchor Structure and Levels","17-Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0820_模块4-超脱者与位面-位面法则稳定永续维护.md","filePath":"en/0820_模块4-超脱者与位面-位面法则稳定永续维护.md"}'),r={name:"en/0820_模块4-超脱者与位面-位面法则稳定永续维护.md"};function o(s,e,l,c,d,h){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-820-transcended-ones-and-planes-perpetual-maintenance-of-plane-law-stability" tabindex="-1">Entry 820 | Transcended Ones and Planes | Perpetual Maintenance of Plane-Law Stability <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-820-transcended-ones-and-planes-perpetual-maintenance-of-plane-law-stability" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 820 | Transcended Ones and Planes | Perpetual Maintenance of Plane-Law Stability&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 27, 20, 17</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-law-stability-is-not-a-one-time-project-but-perpetual-daily-work" tabindex="-1">Introduction: law stability is not a one-time project, but perpetual daily work <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-law-stability-is-not-a-one-time-project-but-perpetual-daily-work" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: law stability is not a one-time project, but perpetual daily work&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Plane-law stability is the precondition of all cultivation activity — laws unstable, the energy cycle breaks; the energy cycle breaks, Myriad Ranks on the plane cannot cultivate, cannot survive. In the old system, plane-law stability was maintained by the plane hegemon&#39;s personal force — hegemon present, laws stable; hegemon gone, laws chaotic. This model&#39;s fragility is obvious: the hegemon cannot guard one place forever; once he leaves, the plane has problems. Heng Yuan Zhou replaces the &quot;hegemon personally garrisoning&quot; model with <strong>anchor infrastructure + transcended one&#39;s perpetual maintenance</strong> — law stability relies not on some person, but on a perpetually running maintenance system.</p><p>Six top-level axioms run through this entry: the anti-predation axiom requires law-stability maintenance not be allowed to be privatized by some strong one; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the maintenance system be transparent to Myriad Ranks and accept Myriad-Rank supervision; the collective ascension axiom requires law stability serve Myriad Ranks&#39; continuous cultivation; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the maintenance process not disturb plane Myriad Ranks&#39; normal life; the law-first axiom ensures maintenance rules themselves are law-level definitions, not bypassed by any emergency.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article focuses: how the transcended one conducts perpetual maintenance of plane-law stability.</p><h2 id="i-law-drift-the-root-of-plane-law-instability" tabindex="-1">I. Law Drift: The Root of Plane-Law Instability <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-law-drift-the-root-of-plane-law-instability" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Law Drift: The Root of Plane-Law Instability&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Plane-law instability&#39;s most common cause is <strong>law drift</strong> — law-operating parameters stored in the law core gradually deviate from standard values over time. Drift causes:</p><ul><li><strong>Energy fluctuation</strong>: imbalance in the plane&#39;s energy cycle causes law parameters to be disturbed by energy fields and shift;</li><li><strong>Cross-plane interaction</strong>: law interactions with other planes may introduce parameter perturbation;</li><li><strong>Cultivation-activity accumulation</strong>: long-term law operations by large numbers of cultivators on the plane produce cumulative fine-tuning on the law network;</li><li><strong>Cosmic overall evolution</strong>: the cosmic structure itself is evolving; underlying law parameters slowly evolve accordingly.</li></ul><p>Law drift itself is not a disaster — it is a normal phenomenon. But if not calibrated, drift gradually accumulates, ultimately causing law parameters to seriously deviate from standard; the plane&#39;s cultivation system begins failing, the energy cycle begins disordering.</p><h2 id="ii-perpetual-maintenance-s-three-defense-lines" tabindex="-1">II. Perpetual Maintenance&#39;s Three Defense Lines <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-perpetual-maintenance-s-three-defense-lines" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Perpetual Maintenance&#39;s Three Defense Lines&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s perpetual maintenance of plane-law stability has three defense lines:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Defense Line</th><th>Maintenance Method</th><th>Execution Frequency</th><th>Executor</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>First defense line</td><td>Anchor auto-calibration</td><td>Real-time continuous</td><td>Anchor calibration ring (automated)</td></tr><tr><td>Second defense line</td><td>Transcended one periodic inspection-calibration</td><td>Per standard cycle</td><td>Transcended one + plane core anchor maintenance team</td></tr><tr><td>Third defense line</td><td>Emergency intervention repair</td><td>Event-triggered</td><td>Transcended one (cross-plane response)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Three defense lines&#39; design logic: <strong>most drift is handled by automated systems (first defense line); the transcended one only handles problems automation cannot handle (second and third defense lines).</strong> This way the transcended one&#39;s energy is not consumed by daily maintenance, concentrated on complex problems.</p><h2 id="iii-the-second-defense-line-the-transcended-one-s-periodic-calibration-work" tabindex="-1">III. The Second Defense Line: The Transcended One&#39;s Periodic Calibration Work <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-second-defense-line-the-transcended-one-s-periodic-calibration-work" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Second Defense Line: The Transcended One&#39;s Periodic Calibration Work&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s concrete work in periodic calibration:</p><ul><li><strong>Law-parameter full detection</strong>: conduct full parameter detection on the plane core anchor&#39;s law core — compare current parameters with standard parameters&#39; deviation, identifying which parameters drift most severely;</li><li><strong>Tiered calibration</strong>: parameters with deviation within tolerance are handed to the automated system for fine-tuning; parameters with deviation exceeding tolerance, the transcended one personally calibrates. The calibration process strictly follows law-anchor authority&#39;s operation norms.</li><li><strong>Cross-plane law-compatibility check</strong>: if the plane has accessed the cross-plane anchor network, the transcended one checks whether cross-plane law-compatible parameters still hold — each plane&#39;s laws in co-evolution may gradually lose match.</li><li><strong>Maintenance report</strong>: after calibration completes, submit a maintenance report — recording which parameters were calibrated this time, pre- and post-calibration deviation, suggested time for next calibration.</li></ul><p>Periodic calibration&#39;s core principle: <strong>preventive maintenance, not post-failure rush repair.</strong> The transcended one does not wait for laws to collapse before repairing, but regularly calibrates while drift is still within tolerance — this way maintenance cost is lowest, impact on Myriad Ranks&#39; life is smallest.</p><h2 id="iv-the-third-defense-line-emergency-intervention-procedure" tabindex="-1">IV. The Third Defense Line: Emergency Intervention Procedure <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-third-defense-line-emergency-intervention-procedure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Third Defense Line: Emergency Intervention Procedure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When plane laws show severe anomaly (drift exceeding tolerance, local law-network collapse, external law-pollution intrusion), the transcended one launches the third defense line — emergency intervention. Procedure:</p><ol><li><strong>Anomaly confirmation</strong>: after Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision alerts, the transcended one immediately confirms the anomaly&#39;s nature, scope, severity;</li><li><strong>Minimal-intervention assessment</strong>: assess the minimal-intervention plan — what automation can solve, do not personally strike; what local repair may do, do not plane-wide overhaul;</li><li><strong>Report execution</strong>: although emergency intervention may execute quickly, after execution must immediately report to the Anchor Supervisory Committee — rescue first then report, not report first then rescue;</li><li><strong>Follow-up tracking</strong>: after intervention completes, continuously track the plane&#39;s law state, confirming repair effects are stable, preventing recurrence.</li></ol><p>Emergency-intervention procedure&#39;s core: <strong>quick but not reckless, decisive but not overreaching.</strong> The transcended one in crisis may act first then report, but he never bypasses Myriad-Rank knowledge — rescue is urgent, transparency is permanent.</p><h2 id="v-why-perpetual-maintenance-maintenance-is-not-a-project-but-a-way-of-life" tabindex="-1">V. Why &quot;Perpetual&quot; Maintenance: Maintenance Is Not a Project, but a Way of Life <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-why-perpetual-maintenance-maintenance-is-not-a-project-but-a-way-of-life" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Why &quot;Perpetual&quot; Maintenance: Maintenance Is Not a Project, but a Way of Life&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The word &quot;perpetual&quot; is this entry&#39;s core. Plane-law stability maintenance is not a project with a beginning and end — it has no completion date. As long as the plane exists, laws drift; as long as laws drift, they need calibration. This is perpetual daily work.</p><p>This perpetuity raises a deep requirement of the transcended one: <strong>he may not treat law maintenance as a &quot;finish-and-leave&quot; errand.</strong> He must accept: this is his eternal post — not eternally guarding one plane, but eternally doing law-maintenance work on some plane. Changing posts does not change nature: from one plane to another, from one cycle to another, law maintenance is always the transcended one&#39;s daily work.</p><p>This is the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm as the &quot;perpetual-post realm&quot; (see entry 710)&#39;s concrete meaning: <strong>the transcended one&#39;s work is not &quot;done then transcended,&quot; but &quot;because eternally doing, eternally transcended.&quot;</strong> He does not finish everything then have nothing to do, but he lets everything run perpetually — this itself is his transcendence.</p><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: three defense lines&#39; tiered design lets automation handle daily maintenance; the transcended one&#39;s energy concentrates on complex problems — neither human resources nor law-operation resources are wasted</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the perpetual maintenance system ensures law stability does not depend on some hegemon&#39;s personal garrisoning, eliminating &quot;under guardianship name actually ruling&quot;</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo system plane laws rely on the hegemon&#39;s personal force; once he leaves they chaos; Heng Yuan Zhou plane laws rely on anchors + transcended one&#39;s perpetual maintenance; the system does not depend on individuals</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: perpetual maintenance covers all planes already connected to the anchor network; no matter plane size or race count, law stability is equal</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: three defense lines, periodic-calibration procedure, and emergency-intervention procedure are all publicly queryable; each plane may supervise whether maintenance is in place</p></li><li><p>Terminology alignment: the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight dynamically adjusts with post performance; the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle ensures energy and knowledge circulate perpetually among Myriad Ranks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Perpetual maintenance of plane-law stability is the transcended one&#39;s &quot;perpetual-motion construction system&quot; daily fulfillment at the plane dimension. Three defense lines tier-process, periodic calibration prevention-first, emergency intervention quick and transparent — maintenance is not a project, but a way of life. In this perpetual maintenance, the transcended one is not a &quot;security guard who leaves after guarding,&quot; but a &quot;gardener forever on post.&quot; What he guards is not some plane&#39;s laws, but the civilizational promise of perpetual law stability for all Myriad-Rank planes. When this promise is perpetually fulfilled, plane Myriad Ranks may cultivate and evolve at ease — because they know, laws are guarded by someone, stability is maintained by someone, the sky will not fall.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/27-锚点校准与维护.html">Entry 27 · Anchor Calibration and Maintenance</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/20-锚点结构与层级.html">Entry 20 · Anchor Structure and Levels</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/816_模块4-超脱者与位面-总论.html">Entry 816 · Transcended Ones and Planes Overview</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const m=n(r,[["render",o]]);export{u as __pageData,m as default};
